#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:6
msgid "Visuo-Tactile Sensor"
msgstr "视触觉传感器"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:9
msgid ""
"The visuo-tactile sensor in Isaac Lab provides realistic tactile feedback "
"through integration with TacSL (Tactile Sensor Learning) [Akinola2025]_. It "
"is designed to simulate high-fidelity tactile interactions, generating both "
"visual and force-based data that mirror real-world tactile sensors like "
"GelSight devices. The sensor can provide tactile RGB images, force field "
"distributions, and other intermediate tactile measurements essential for "
"robotic manipulation tasks requiring fine tactile feedback."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的视触觉传感器通过集成 TacSL（Tactile Sensor Learning） "
"[Akinola2025]_，提供逼真的触觉反馈。它模拟高保真的触觉交互，生成与 GelSight 等真实触觉传感器相对应的视觉和力数据，能够输出触觉 "
"RGB 图像、力场分布及其他中间触觉测量值，适用于需要精细触觉反馈的机器人操作任务。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:12
msgid "Tactile sensor with RGB visualization and force fields"
msgstr "带有 RGB 可视化和力场的触觉传感器"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:19
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:21
msgid ""
"Tactile sensors require specific configuration parameters to define their "
"behavior and data collection properties. The sensor can be configured with "
"various parameters including sensor resolution, force sensitivity, and "
"output data types."
msgstr "触觉传感器需要特定的配置参数来定义其行为和数据采集属性。传感器可以配置各种参数，包括传感器分辨率、力敏感度和输出数据类型。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:58
msgid "The configuration supports customization of:"
msgstr "配置支持自定义以下内容: "

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Render Configuration**: Specify the GelSight sensor rendering parameters "
"using predefined configs (e.g., ``GELSIGHT_R15_CFG``, ``GELSIGHT_MINI_CFG`` "
"from ``isaaclab_assets.sensors``)"
msgstr ""
"**渲染配置**: 使用预定义配置（例如来自 ``isaaclab_assets.sensors`` 的 ``GELSIGHT_R15_CFG`` 、 "
"``GELSIGHT_MINI_CFG`` ）指定 GelSight 传感器渲染参数"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:62
msgid "**Tactile Modalities**:"
msgstr "**触觉模态**:"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:63
msgid ""
"``enable_camera_tactile`` - Enable tactile RGB imaging through camera "
"sensors"
msgstr "``enable_camera_tactile`` - 通过相机传感器启用触觉 RGB 成像"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:64
msgid ""
"``enable_force_field`` - Enable force field computation and visualization"
msgstr "``enable_force_field`` - 启用力场计算和可视化"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Force Field Grid**: Set tactile grid dimensions (``tactile_array_size``) "
"and margins, which directly affects the spatial resolution of the computed "
"force field"
msgstr "**力场网格**: 设置触觉网格尺寸（ ``tactile_array_size`` ）和边距，这直接影响计算力场的空间分辨率"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Contact Object Configuration**: Define properties of interacting objects "
"using prim path expressions to locate objects with SDF collision meshes"
msgstr "**接触对象配置**: 使用 prim 路径表达式定义交互对象的属性，以定位具有 SDF 碰撞网格的对象"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:67
msgid "**Physics Parameters**: Control the sensor's force field computation:"
msgstr "**物理参数**: 控制传感器的力场计算:"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:68
msgid ""
"``normal_contact_stiffness``, ``friction_coefficient``, "
"``tangential_stiffness`` - Normal stiffness, friction coefficient, and "
"tangential stiffness"
msgstr ""
"``normal_contact_stiffness``, ``friction_coefficient``, "
"``tangential_stiffness`` - 法向刚度、摩擦系数和切向刚度"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Camera Settings**: Configure resolution, update rates, and data types "
"using :class:`~sensors.CameraCfg`. Currently only "
"``distance_to_image_plane`` (alias for ``depth``) is supported."
msgstr ""
"**相机设置** ：使用 :class:`~sensors.CameraCfg` 配置分辨率、更新频率和数据类型。目前只支持 "
"``distance_to_image_plane`` （ ``depth`` 的别名）。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:70
msgid ""
"``spawn`` is set to ``None`` by default, which means that the camera is "
"already spawned in the USD file. If you want to spawn the camera yourself "
"and set focal length, etc., you can set the spawn configuration to a valid "
"spawn configuration."
msgstr ""
"``spawn`` 默认设置为 ``None`` ，这意味着相机已在 USD 文件中生成。如果您想自己生成相机并设置焦距等，可以将 spawn "
"配置设置为有效的生成配置。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:74
msgid "Configuration Requirements"
msgstr "配置要求"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:77
msgid ""
"The following requirements must be satisfied for proper sensor operation:"
msgstr "传感器正常运行必须满足以下要求:"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:79
msgid "**Camera Tactile Imaging**"
msgstr "**相机触觉成像**"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:80
msgid ""
"If ``enable_camera_tactile=True``, a valid ``camera_cfg`` (CameraCfg) must "
"be provided with appropriate camera parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``enable_camera_tactile=True`` ，必须提供有效的 ``camera_cfg`` "
"（CameraCfg），并设置合适的相机参数。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:82
msgid "**Force Field Computation**"
msgstr "**力场计算**"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:83
msgid "If ``enable_force_field=True``, the following parameters are required:"
msgstr "如果 ``enable_force_field=True`` ，需要以下参数: "

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:85
msgid ""
"``contact_object_prim_path_expr`` - Prim path expression to locate contact "
"objects with SDF collision meshes"
msgstr "``contact_object_prim_path_expr`` - 用于定位具有 SDF 碰撞网格的接触对象的 Prim 路径表达式"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:87
msgid "**SDF Computation**"
msgstr "**SDF 计算**"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:88
msgid ""
"When force field computation is enabled, penalty-based normal and shear "
"forces are computed using Signed Distance Field (SDF) queries. To achieve "
"GPU acceleration:"
msgstr "当启用力场计算时，使用符号距离场（SDF）查询计算基于惩罚的法向力和剪切力。要实现 GPU 加速: "

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:90
msgid "Interacting objects should have SDF collision meshes"
msgstr "交互对象应具有 SDF 碰撞网格"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:91
msgid ""
"An SDFView must be defined during initialization, therefore interacting "
"objects should be specified before simulation."
msgstr "必须在初始化期间定义 SDFView，因此应在仿真之前指定交互对象。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:93
msgid "**Elastomer Configuration**"
msgstr "**弹性体配置**"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:94
msgid ""
"The sensor's ``prim_path`` must be configured as a child of the elastomer "
"prim in the USD hierarchy. The query points for the force field computation "
"is computed from the surface of the elastomer mesh, which is searched for "
"under the prim path of the elastomer."
msgstr ""
"传感器的 ``prim_path`` 必须配置为 USD 层次结构中弹性体 prim 的子级。力场计算的查询点是从弹性体网格表面计算的，该网格在弹性体的"
" prim 路径下搜索。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:97
msgid "**Physics Materials**"
msgstr "**物理材质**"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:98
msgid ""
"The sensor uses physics materials to configure the compliant contact "
"properties of the elastomer. By default, physics material properties are "
"pre-configured in the USD asset. However, you can override these properties "
"by specifying the following parameters in ``UsdFileWithCompliantContactCfg``"
" when spawning the robot:"
msgstr ""
"传感器使用物理材质来配置弹性体的柔顺接触属性。默认情况下，物理材质属性已在 USD 资产中预配置。但是，您可以在生成机器人时通过在 "
"``UsdFileWithCompliantContactCfg`` 中指定以下参数来覆盖这些属性: "

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:103
msgid ""
"``compliant_contact_stiffness`` - Contact stiffness for the elastomer "
"surface"
msgstr "``compliant_contact_stiffness`` - 弹性体表面的接触刚度"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:104
msgid ""
"``compliant_contact_damping`` - Contact damping for the elastomer surface"
msgstr "``compliant_contact_damping`` - 弹性体表面的接触阻尼"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:105
msgid ""
"``physics_material_prim_path`` - Prim path where physics material is applied"
" (typically ``\"elastomer\"``)"
msgstr "``physics_material_prim_path`` - 应用物理材质的 Prim 路径（通常为 ``\"elastomer\"`` ）"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:107
msgid ""
"If any parameter is set to ``None``, the corresponding property from the USD"
" asset will be retained."
msgstr "如果任何参数设置为 ``None`` ，将保留 USD 资产中的相应属性。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:111
msgid "Usage Example"
msgstr "使用示例"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:113
msgid ""
"To use the tactile sensor in a simulation environment, run the example:"
msgstr "在仿真环境中使用触觉传感器，可运行以下示例："

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:0
