msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:129
msgid "Available command-line options include:"
msgstr "可用的命令行选项包括: "

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:131
msgid "``--use_tactile_rgb``: Enable camera-based tactile sensing"
msgstr "``--use_tactile_rgb``: 启用基于相机的触觉感知"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:132
msgid "``--use_tactile_ff``: Enable force field tactile sensing"
msgstr "``--use_tactile_ff``: 启用力场触觉感知"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:133
msgid ""
"``--contact_object_type``: Specify the type of contact object (nut, cube, "
"etc.)"
msgstr "``--contact_object_type``: 指定接触对象的类型（螺母、立方体等）"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:134
msgid "``--num_envs``: Number of parallel environments"
msgstr "``--num_envs``: 并行环境数量"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:135
msgid "``--save_viz``: Save visualization outputs for analysis"
msgstr "``--save_viz``: 保存可视化输出以供分析"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:136
msgid ""
"``--tactile_compliance_stiffness``: Override compliant contact stiffness "
"(default: use USD asset values)"
msgstr "``--tactile_compliance_stiffness``: 覆盖柔顺接触刚度（默认: 使用 USD 资产值）"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:137
msgid ""
"``--tactile_compliant_damping``: Override compliant contact damping "
"(default: use USD asset values)"
msgstr "``--tactile_compliant_damping``: 覆盖柔顺接触阻尼（默认: 使用 USD 资产值）"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:138
msgid ""
"``--normal_contact_stiffness``: Normal contact stiffness for force field "
"computation"
msgstr "``--normal_contact_stiffness``: 力场计算的法向接触刚度"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:139
msgid "``--tangential_stiffness``: Tangential stiffness for shear forces"
msgstr "``--tangential_stiffness``: 剪切力的切向刚度"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:140
msgid "``--friction_coefficient``: Friction coefficient for shear forces"
msgstr "``--friction_coefficient``: 剪切力的摩擦系数"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:141
msgid ""
"``--viz``: Select one or more visualizers, such as ``kit`` or ``newton``"
msgstr "``--viz`` ：选择一个或多个可视化器，例如 ``kit`` 或 ``newton``"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:142
msgid ""
"``--debug_sdf_closest_pts``: Visualize closest SDF points for debugging"
msgstr "``--debug_sdf_closest_pts``: 可视化最近的 SDF 点以进行调试"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:143
msgid ""
"``--debug_tactile_sensor_pts``: Visualize tactile sensor points for "
"debugging"
msgstr "``--debug_tactile_sensor_pts``: 可视化触觉传感器点以进行调试"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:144
msgid ""
"``--trimesh_vis_tactile_points``: Enable trimesh-based visualization of "
"tactile points"
msgstr "``--trimesh_vis_tactile_points``: 启用基于 trimesh 的触觉点可视化"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:148
msgid ""
"Since Isaac Lab 3.0, visualizers are selected independently from the "
"simulation backend. Use the ``--viz`` argument to choose the visualizer "
"backend, such as ``kit`` or ``newton``. The TacSL example currently supports"
" only the PhysX simulation backend; running the tactile sensor simulation "
"with the Newton backend is not supported."
msgstr ""
"从 Isaac Lab 3.0 开始，可视化器与仿真后端分别选择。通过 ``--viz`` 指定 ``kit`` 或 ``newton`` "
"等可视化后端。TacSL 示例目前只支持 PhysX 仿真后端，不支持使用 Newton 后端运行触觉传感器仿真。"

#: source/experimental-features/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:154
msgid "For a complete list of available options:"
msgstr "要获取完整的可用选项列表: "

