msgid ""
"The examples are based on the Gelsight R1.5, which is a prototype sensor "
"that is now discontinued. The same procedure can be adapted for other "
"visuotactile sensors."
msgstr "示例基于 Gelsight R1.5，这是一款现已停产的原型传感器。同样的流程可适配其他视觉触觉传感器。"

